","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0254","start":254,"end":256,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p061","text":"懷公故大臣呂省、郤芮本不附文公，文公立，恐誅，乃欲與其徒謀燒公宮，殺文公。文公不知。始嘗欲殺文公宦者履鞮知其謀，欲以告文公，解前罪，求見文公。文公不見，使人讓曰：「蒲城之事，女斬予袪。其後我從狄君獵，女爲惠公來求殺我。惠公與女期三日至，而女一日至，何速也？女其念之。」宦者曰：「臣刀鋸之餘，不敢以二心事君倍主，故得罪於君。君已反國，其毋蒲、翟乎？且管仲射鉤，桓公以霸。今刑餘之人以事告而君不見，禍又且及矣。」於是見之，遂以呂、郤等告文公。文公欲召呂、郤，呂、郤等黨多，文公恐初入國，國人賣己，乃爲微行，會秦繆公於王城，國人莫知。三月己丑，呂、郤等果反，焚公宮，不得文公。文公之衞徒與戰，呂、郤等引兵欲奔，秦繆公誘呂、郤等，殺之河上，晉國復而文公得歸。夏，迎夫人於秦，秦所與文公妻者卒爲夫人。秦送三千人爲衞，以備晉亂。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m061-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"懷公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000390","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m061-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"呂省","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001728","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m061-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"郤芮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m061-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m061-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m061-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m061-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m061-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m061-0050","start":50,"end":52,"s